    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in your [Charge phase](vsdata:core-rule/charge-phase) on a unit of **NEOPHYTE HYBRIDS**, **ACOLYTE HYBRIDS** or **HYBRID METAMORPHS** that has yet to declare a charge. That unit may declare a charge despite having [Advanced](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) or [Fallen Back](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back) this turn. At its declaration, you may invoke the second part to reroll its [charge roll](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step). If you invoke it, end the move in [engagement](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) with an enemy unit that a friendly **CHARACTER** unit is also engaging.",
